&lt;p&gt;Doctolib is looking for a&lt;strong&gt; Talent Acquisition Coordinator &lt;/strong&gt;to join the Tech &amp;amp; Product Talent Acquisition team in our &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt; office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Coordinator, you&#39;ll focus on three essential areas: delivering exceptional candidate experience, mastering complex tech &amp;amp; product interview scheduling, and continuously improving our interview processes. In this role, you&#39;ll gain comprehensive insight into recruitment while applying your organisational and project management skills in a fast-paced, high-volume environment and developing advanced people skills through multi-stakeholder management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an intern, you will support us in the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate interviews between candidates, Hiring Managers and tech interviewers, ensuring a smooth candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Send critical candidate communication during the recruitment process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain accurate candidate and interview information in our Applicant Tracking System.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complex interviewer pools, candidate information and interview supporting materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt and streamline the scheduling process to suit candidates and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to interview process design, track scheduling metrics (time to schedule, time to interview) and own your own projects with a focus on process improvement while leveraging AI and automation tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Talent Acquisition Partners and Hiring Managers on Tech &amp;amp; Product recruitment end to end processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working with us, you will learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How the full Talent Acquisition process works, from application to onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to coordinate recruitment processes in an international technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to work with an Applicant Tracking System and recruitment-related data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to collaborate with candidates, Hiring Managers and internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to contribute to a positive and inclusive candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How Talent Acquisition supports the growth of Tech &amp;amp; Product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You could be our next teammate if you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational skills, attention to detail, sense of urgency, and agility that enable you to stay on top of priorities and manage multiple tasks simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong empathy that allows you to put yourself in other people&#39;s shoes and a genuine passion for finding solutions that work best for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A curious, problem-solving mindset with a willingness to learn and dig deeper to understand how operations and processes work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable leveraging AI tools to streamline daily tasks, draft communications, and improve efficiency, with curiosity to keep learning new AI-powered ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English with strong verbal and written communication skills, allowing you to adapt your expression to different audiences and situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Now, it would be fantastic if you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak German at B2 level or above.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have previous experience with an Applicant Tracking System, HR administration or coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in an international, technology or fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured and personalised onboarding programme through our Doctolib Academy, as well as a wide range of in-house training opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible working model that allows for hybrid and office-based work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Deutschlandticket sponsored by Doctolib, or reimbursement of your semester ticket, subject to the applicable eligibility rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 vacation days per year, calculated pro rata according to your working schedule and internship duration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular breakfast in the office and subsidies for your lunch or grocery shopping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised sports programme with our partner Urban Sports Club.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First call with Hiring Manager (30’)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study Interview (60’)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship in full-time (40h/week).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Duration: 6 months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workplace: Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: €1,900 gross/month for a mandatory internship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: €2,425 gross/month for a voluntary internship; €2,545 gross/month from 1 January 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: As soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work in a hybrid setup (3 office days/week).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g. pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Scheduling&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to give practitioners their day back:&amp;nbsp; reclaiming the admin time they spend creating and managing appointments, so care teams can focus on what matters. You will work in a feature team developing scheduling infrastructure and booking experiences, contributing directly to a platform that books billions of appointments a year for health professionals and patients across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead a team of 6 to 7 engineers&lt;/strong&gt; of mixed seniority, owning delivery, quality and production health end to end — keeping engagement high and standards higher&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Together with your product partner, define the mission and vision for your team and build a roadmap you can defend to stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in architecture reviews and help shape the technical direction of the Scheduling stream, including the migration of core scheduling capabilities from the monolith into purpose-built services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and uphold the security, reliability, performance and scalability standards required to remain the most trusted e-health SaaS in Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Talent and People teams to recruit, develop and retain engineers through career conversations and feedback they can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed AI-assisted engineering into how your team works day to day, with a clear and honest view of where it helps and where it does not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve how the team operates — planning, on-call, bug backlog, incident follow-up — so the team spends its energy on what moves the needle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have at least &lt;strong&gt;6 years&lt;/strong&gt; of software engineering experience and &lt;strong&gt;3 years&lt;/strong&gt; of engineering management experience, including leading a team of 5+ engineers through delivery, hiring and growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are credible with senior backend engineers — distributed systems, data modelling, latency and throughput are conversations you can hold and challenge; you stay close enough to the code to review a pull request, without needing to be the one writing it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have hands-on experience &lt;strong&gt;modernising a large legacy system&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally extracting services from a monolith, and know how to keep a team delivering while the ground moves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are an effective communicator who can translate company goals into team objectives, and who says the uncomfortable thing early rather than late&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think critically and objectively, with a solution-oriented approach that brings people with you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in a regulated industry such as healthcare or fintech, where privacy and data protection shape design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have navigated hyper-growth environments and understand the trade-offs they force on architecture and team organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have formed a considered view on AI coding assistants — their real benefits and their real shortcomings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack in this product area is Ruby on Rails and TypeScript/React in the monolith, Kotlin for new services, with Postgres, Redis and Kafka underneath.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Deutschlandticket (Germany-wide public transport pass) fully paid for by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 vacation days + 1 additional day for each full calendar year of employment (up to a maximum of 30 days)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company health insurance with great supplementary benefits through our partner Allianz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme (bAV) through Allianz with an employer subsidy of 40% (15% within the probationary period)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Doctolib Parent Care program, which includes one month additional parental leave and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidized sports membership through our partner Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible workplace policy offering both hybrid and office-based mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alongside healthy snacks and our regular breakfast buffet, we provide a subsidized meal benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support in case of international mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System Design Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering Manager Case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot;&gt; candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
